      "note": "Reviewed the exploit receipt and call trace, router creation, selector-to-module storage and events, the complete 50-event module history through the exploit, and the commit-pinned replay. The exploit invokes selectors 0xea7faa61 and 0x4112e1c2 at router 0xeeeeee53033f7227d488ae83a27bc9a9d5051756; both delegate to module 0x88eb28009351fb414a5746f5d8ca91cdc02760d8. Their event histories contain an initial selection of 0x626784d4af1e8d37b13b42f5fd2c9959c1711952 and one replacement each: block 20820498 for 0x4112e1c2 and block 20820500 log 269 for 0xea7faa61. No later selection event for either selector occurred. The receipt records exact resolver outflows of 1,291.161105215879179270 WETH, 206,282.446876 USDT, 16.93910519 WBTC, and 1,268,771.488879 USDC, offset by 0.000004 USDC paid to the resolver."
